      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我对于能够参与历史悠久的“神马驱”，\n有机会将自己的名字留在其中一角，感到万分喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd39ae7ed9f4f2208380cb50941094298dc488166547d260124e5fa47013a126",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
