      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我希望进一步将这次结果化为助力，让未来的我发出\n更耀眼的光辉……这便是我接下“神马驱”任务时的内心想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "995a5c14e2392cf765dd7c0c088e037233164065070d9acbd8f1bc1e7ef3c8ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
